menu "Geophys acquisition diagnostics"

config GEOPHYS_ADC_SCOPE_TEST
    bool "Run the AD7779 scope test instead of the product application"
    default n
    help
        Power and configure the AD7779 for all eight channels at the 1 kSPS
        preset, then leave it running without mounting or writing the SD card.
        This bench-only mode intentionally disables the host protocol and
        exists for MCLK, START, and DRDY oscilloscope measurements.

endmenu
